### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### Tokens  (replace with real values from Keycloak)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
@baseUrl    = http://localhost:8080
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_BEARER_TOKEN
@userToken  = REPLACE_WITH_USER_BEARER_TOKEN

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### CATEGORIES
### ═══════════════════════════════════════

### [1] List all categories  (USER or ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### [2] Get category by ID  (USER or ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### [3] Create category  (ADMIN only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics",
  "description": "Electronic devices and accessories"
}

###

### [4] Update category  (ADMIN only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics & Gadgets",
  "description": "Updated description for electronics"
}

###

### [5] Delete category  (ADMIN only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### ITEMS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════

### [6] List all items  (USER or ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

### [7] Get item by ID  (USER or ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###

### [8] Create item  (ADMIN only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Pro 15",
  "description": "High-performance laptop for professionals",
  "price": 1299.99,
  "categoryId": 1
}

###

### [9] Update item  (ADMIN only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Pro 15 (2025)",
  "description": "Refreshed model with better battery",
  "price": 1199.99,
  "categoryId": 1
}

###

### [10] Delete item  (ADMIN only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
